  "notes": "No sun drawn and no sky mood in 78; Ibrahim gets no motif. 78:5-7 «هذا ربي» is not glossed alone (the previous video carries the tafsirs' framing); only «من الكوكب ومن القمر» under «هذا أكبر». Geometric for «للذي فطر السماوات والأرض». STAGING v4: c1: Ibrahim (blue drop) with his people (3 men) at dawn; the sun rises in the sky of the stage (sunrise_open on 78:3) and its setting is a camera tilt to the ground (78:11). He speaks to his people at 78:5 (argument, both tafsirs): nothing is gestured or zoomed on 78:6-7, no glow, no look up there. He declares his disavowal (shake_head on 78:15) facing his people. c2 (79): his declaration to his people at dusk, geometric for the Creator (79:4-7), a head shake on 79:9 (not one of the polytheists). No idols drawn."
 },
